        More about me
      </h2>
      <p
        class="w-full max-w-lg text-left text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed animate-text-fade-in"
      >
        AI/ML Engineer with hands-on experience building production-grade AI automation and data-driven systems through internships and structured training. I have worked on automated order processing, document ingestion, data extraction, rule-based validation, workflow orchestration, and backend automation, contributing to improved accuracy and operational efficiency in real-world systems.

        Alongside my internship experience, I completed a comprehensive Data Science and AI/ML training program aligned with the CRISP-ML(Q) methodology, building a strong foundation in data analysis, machine learning, deep learning, time-series forecasting, NLP, and data visualization.

        I am comfortable working across the end-to-end AI lifecycle—from data preparation and modeling to automation, validation, and deployment—using Python, SQL, ML/DL techniques, LLM-based workflows (LangChain, LangGraph), APIs, and MLOps practices.

        I am seeking AI/ML Engineering or Data Science roles where I can help build scalable, reliable systems that turn data into actionable business outcomes.
      </p>
